    "long_instructions": "# Potential Benefits and Risks of AI in Education\r\n\r\n#### We've all experienced situations such as the ones described in the scenarios on the previous level. These scenarios highlight both some of the benefits and risks of AI in education. Take a look at the graphic below that summarizes and categorizes these benefits and risks.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://images.code.org/87f60e79b8d9db1cdc81f7251d510b47-Screenshot 2024-04-15 at 1.33.49 PM.png\" alt=\"Potential benefits and risks of AI in education.\"></p>\r\n\r\n*Image: TeachAI*\r\n\r\n\r\n## Reflection\r\n\r\n> #### In the reflection box below, answer the following questions:\r\n> - #### Which of the benefits above are you most excited about? How can you share this excitement with your students? \r\n> - #### Which are you most concerned about? How can you share these concerns with your administrators?\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: left; margin:20px 0px 30px 0px\">\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://forum.code.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/7dbe63a051fbad4ef262d6ab710e2966-image-1731959037460.png\" style=\"width: auto; height: 100px;\"  alt=\"A browser with two text boxes, both including an avatar and lines of text.\"></a>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color: #007786; border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 20px; color: #000000; width: 80%; margin-left: 5%; margin-right: 5%; padding: 10px 10px 5px 10px;\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color: white; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 18px\"><b>Post to the Code.org Forum</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color: white; line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; font-size: 18px\">Share your response and read other educators' ideas on the forum! Click on the icon to the left to direct to our forum post.\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<br>",
